# Audio assets live in this directory.
#
# ``bullet_fire*.wav`` are shipped SFX (44100 Hz / 16-bit / mono,
# sfxr-style laser zap) generated by ``scripts/generate_bullet_fire_wav.py``
# and loaded by ``airwar/audio/sound_manager.py`` with round-robin
# playback; a same-recipe procedural fallback covers missing files.
# BGM wiring (``play_bgm`` / ``stop_bgm``) activates once music assets
# are added here.
